|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `M1-EARLY-TEMPLATE-VALUE-RECON-STRENGTH0-FIXED46-20261023` | Same candidate checkpoint SHA256 `a2c6846b321990cb06c58187e7e34c8016d79`; strength-0 config `M1_EARLY_TEMPLATE_VALUE_RECON_STRENGTH0_FIXED46_20261023.yaml` | LasHeR train calibration；23 sequences x pre/onset=46 fixed states；FP32 paired replay；only MAX_DELTA=0 | strength1-strength0 IoU `-0.000248`; CENTER rank 46/46 unchanged; query rank 46/46 unchanged | `DIAGNOSTIC-COMPLETE / REFUTED-AS-LOCATING-MECHANISM / STOP-CANDIDATE` | `experiments/reports/m1_early_template_value_reconstruction_fixed46_20261023.md`; `output/experiments/M1_EARLY_TEMPLATE_VALUE_RECON_STRENGTH0_FIXED46_20261023/` |
| `M1-CANDIDATE-ROUTE-DECISION-20261023` | Audit of Candidate 1 strength0/1 paired fixed46, Candidate 2 matched sparse-neck 16-epoch proxy, and T2S contract diagnostics | Route decision; no new training or inference | NA | `DECISION / CANDIDATE1-STOP / CANDIDATE2-CONTRACT-GATE`。候选一首轮 candidate-parent 混用不同 checkpoint，不能因果归因；同 checkpoint strength0/1 效应近零。既有 neck_union 代理训练 margin小幅上升，但CENTER rank和replay IoU下降。今晚不升同一 neck_union 为全量；仅评估实现真正空间对应bridge后的合同与固定状态准入 | `新方案`; `experiments/reports/m1_early_template_value_reconstruction_fixed46_20261023.md`; `experiments/reports/m1_sparse_cross_neck_shifted_control_20261022.md`; `experiments/reports/m1_t2s_conditioned_message_fixed46_20261023.md` |

### 候选路线裁决（2026-10-23）

候选一首次 candidate-parent fixed46 差值不可作因果证据：M1 epoch15 parent 与 Early-Conditioned Gate full-15 后续训1 epoch candidate checkpoint 不同。后续 strength 0/1 同 checkpoint 对照才隔离新增残差，效应近零，故停止当前候选形式的训练扩展。候选二的 `neck_union` 已完成 16 epoch/176序列代理训练，CENTER margin小幅改善但rank和fixed replay IoU退化；该机制不升full。真正的空间对应 token bridge 与 `neck_union` 尚有算子差异，允许先做独立实现和低成本合同/固定状态筛选，通过后再决定 full run。证据见 `新方案`、`m1_sparse_cross_neck_shifted_control_20261022.md`、`m1_early_template_value_reconstruction_fixed46_20261023.md`。

