| `M1-AMCM-NLFORMER-RESIDUAL-ROUTE-20261020` | 仅在 AMCM 内用 RGB/TIR 模板匹配图直接路由 NLformer residual 空间幅度；主体、pre-fusion 注入、loss、head 和 tracker 不变 | LasHeR train 512 samples/epoch × 3 epochs；published SOT pretrained initialization；FP32；`NUM_WORKER=4`；固定 10 失败帧合同诊断 | `FIXED10-COMPLETE / NOT-PROMOTED`。平均 IoU delta `-0.04870`；GT rank 改善 1/10；RGB/TIR residual target/background 比 `0.3146/0.2631`，确认路由强化背景而非目标。停止 50 序列扩展 | `experiments/reports/m1_amcm_nlformer_spatial_residual_gate_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_AMCM_NLFORMER_SPATIAL_RESIDUAL_GATE_QUICK15_3EP_20261020/{checkpoints/TBSITrack_ep0003.pth.tar,logs}`; `output/experiments/M1_AMCM_NLFORMER_SPATIAL_RESIDUAL_GATE_FIXED10_DIAG_20261020/per_event.csv` | 该实验只用于区分“输出均匀”与“模板路由方向错误”；下一步若继续只能加最小 RGB/TIR 一致性校验，不能增大 route 强度或直接 full training |
| `M1-AMCM-NLFORMER-CONSENSUS-RESIDUAL-ROUTE-20261020` | 仅在 AMCM 内用 `min(S_rgb,S_tir)` 双模态模板匹配共识图路由 NLformer residual；主体、pre-fusion 注入、loss、head 和 tracker 不变 | LasHeR train 512 samples/epoch × 3 epochs；published SOT pretrained initialization；FP32；`NUM_WORKER=4`；同一固定 10 失败帧合同诊断 | `FIXED10-COMPLETE / NOT-PROMOTED`。平均固定状态 IoU `0.30133→0.25323`，delta `-0.04810`；GT rank 改善 1/10，top-1 转回 GT 为 0/10；RGB/TIR residual target/background 比均值 `0.2683`，10/10 背景主导；空间 CV 约 `1.04`；融合前后特征范数变化小于 `0.1%`。一致性产生了结构化 residual，但没有产生目标选择性且下游被显著削弱 | `experiments/reports/m1_amcm_nlformer_consensus_residual_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_AMCM_NLFORMER_CONSENSUS_RESIDUAL_GATE_FIXED10_DIAG_20261020/{per_event.csv,paired_per_sequence.csv,summary.json}`; `output/experiments/M1_AMCM_NLFORMER_CONSENSUS_RESIDUAL_GATE_QUICK15_3EP_20261020/checkpoints/TBSITrack_ep0003.pth.tar`; `tools/run_m1_nlformer_consensus_residual_gate_fixed10_diagnostic_20261020.py` | 该结果排除“只需双模态共识即可解决背景误导”；不进入 50 序列。下一步只能在 AMCM 内验证目标/硬背景 ranking 监督或可测量的有效注入，禁止直接增大 route 强度 |
| `M1-FAIR-CONTROL-PRETRAIN-QUICK-20261020` | AMCM 关闭的公平 3-epoch parent control | LasHeR train 512 samples/epoch × 3 epochs；公开 SOT pretrained；FP32；`NUM_WORKER=4`；固定 10 事件 | `FAIR-CONTROL-COMPLETE`。固定 10 帧平均 IoU `0.29641`，作为同进度候选对照；训练首次保存中间权重时磁盘不足，随后清理中间权重并从公开预训练重跑，仅保留 ep0003 | `experiments/reports/m1_amcm_consensus_residual_rank_fair_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_FAIR_CONTROL_FIXED10_DIAG_20261020/per_event.csv`; `output/experiments/M1_FAIR_CONTROL_PRETRAIN_QUICK15_3EP_20261020/checkpoints/TBSITrack_ep0003.pth.tar` | 该 control 用于修正候选与 M1 15 epoch 的训练进度混杂；不作为 M1 正式指标 |
| `M1-AMCM-CONSENSUS-RESIDUAL-RANK-FAIR-20261020` | AMCM consensus residual route plus AMCM-specific GT/hard-background residual-energy hinge ranking; only AMCM path and its opt-in loss enabled | LasHeR train 512 samples/epoch × 3 epochs；公开 SOT pretrained；FP32；`NUM_WORKER=4`；固定同一 10 事件；ranking weight `0.50`, margin `0.05`, top-1 hard background | `FAIR-FIXED10-COMPLETE / NOT-PROMOTED`。相对公平 control，平均 IoU `0.29641→0.25275`，delta `-0.04366`；GT rank `3.8→4.5`；RGB/TIR residual target/background 均值约 `0.2685`，仍 10/10 背景主导。AMCM 梯度持续非零，`nlformer_alpha≈0.0168`，但残差能量监督未转化为目标选择性 | `experiments/reports/m1_amcm_consensus_residual_rank_fair_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_AMCM_CONSENSUS_RESIDUAL_RANK_FIXED10_DIAG_20261020/{per_event.csv,summary.json}`; `output/experiments/M1_FAIR_CONTROL_FIXED10_DIAG_20261020/per_event.csv`; `tools/run_m1_consensus_rank_fixed10_diagnostic_20261020.py`; `experiments/tbsi_track/M1_AMCM_CONSENSUS_RESIDUAL_RANK_QUICK15_3EP_20261020.yaml` | 已排除“仅加入 residual 能量 ranking 即可修复失败帧”；不进入 50 序列。若继续，只检验经过 `tbsi_fuse_search` 的 signed target/background feature margin，不再增加 route 强度 |
| `M1-TEMPLATE-UNCERTAINTY-MSHA-DIAGNOSTIC-20261020` | 冻结 M1 epoch15；仅在 `V2TemplateFusion` 对模板 key 加 RGB/TIR cosine agreement soft participation，`off` 为同入口 parent | LasHeR test 固定 20 failure + 5 control events；FP32；闭环前缀；无训练 | `DIAGNOSTIC-COMPLETE / NOT-PROMOTED`。`soft(τ=0.5,T=0.15)` 相对同入口 `off` 的 event IoU 平均 `-0.01647`，8 胜/13 负；participation 均值 `0.68329`，cross-route mass 变化约 `0.004`、message/input norm 变化 `0.00055`，未见目标选择性证据 | `experiments/reports/m1_template_uncertainty_msha_diagnostic_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_TEMPLATE_UNCERTAINTY_{OFF,SOFT_T05}_20261020/per_sequence.csv`; `output/experiments/M1_TEMPLATE_UNCERTAINTY_{OFF,SOFT_T05}_DIAG_20261020/diagnostics.jsonl` | agreement-only uncertainty 暂不支持训练；若继续只检验 query-conditioned target information，不扩大模块或强度 |
| `M1-TEMPLATE-QUERY-UNCERTAINTY-DIAGNOSTIC-20261020` | 冻结 M1 epoch15；仅在 `V2TemplateFusion` 用 template-search max cosine 与 RGB/TIR agreement 混合生成 template-key soft participation | LasHeR test 固定 20 failure + 5 control events；FP32；闭环前缀；无训练 | `DIAGNOSTIC-COMPLETE / ADMITTED-FOR-FIXED-FRAME-ANALYSIS`。相对同入口 off，all event IoU `+0.02587`，failure `+0.03412`；7/20 failure 上升、9/20 下降；`whitesuvturn +0.9376` 与 `leftunderbasket -0.6570` 并存；message/input norm `0.12414`，未形成稳定目标选择性 | `experiments/reports/m1_template_query_uncertainty_diagnostic_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_TEMPLATE_QUERY_UNCERTAINTY_T05_20261020/{per_sequence.csv,summary.json,diagnostics.jsonl}` | 固定状态 stage follow-up 已登记为 `M1-TEMPLATE-QUERY-STAGE-DIAGNOSTIC-20261020`：loc3 起 query match 已偏向模板背景token，未见CENTER rank改善；候选仍不训练、不增大强度 |
| `M1-TEMPLATE-QUERY-UNCERTAINTY-FIXED25-ANALYSIS-20261020` | 冻结 M1；同一 template/state/crop 下配对 `off` 与 query-conditioned template-key participation；只测当前帧直接定位 | LasHeR test 固定 20 failure + 5 control events；FP32；固定状态；无训练 | `FIXED25-COMPLETE / NOT-PROMOTED`。all event IoU `-0.01584`，failure `-0.01976`；mean peak margin `-0.00096`；仅 `rightcar-chongT` 发生 GT→background top-1 翻转并下降 `-0.3981`；feature target-background L2 delta `-0.01398`、cosine delta `1.2e-5`，说明主要是微小峰扰动而非表征分离 | `experiments/reports/m1_query_uncertainty_fixed25_analysis_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_QUERY_UNCERTAINTY_FIXED25_ANALYSIS_20261020/{per_event.csv,summary.json,rerun.log}` | 闭环大幅变化在固定状态下消失，归因于状态反馈；query participation 不进入训练，下一步应停止扩大强度，回到目标条件/峰排序信号 |
| `M1-TEMPLATE-QUERY-STAGE-DIAGNOSTIC-20261020` | 冻结 M1 epoch15；只比较 `V2TemplateFusion` 的 `off` 与 query-conditioned participation；hook 记录模板、TBSI search、`tbsi_fuse_search` 和 CENTER 阶段 | LasHeR trainingset identity-calibration-v2 validation 18 序列，按首个 IoU<0.30 且 GT 完全在 crop 内选出5事件；另含2个已知 test 案例但不并入 validation 统计；FP32；同 template/state/crop；无训练 | `DIAGNOSTIC-COMPLETE / QUERY-ESTIMATOR-NOT-PROMOTED`。validation 5事件中GT rank改善0/5，CENTER GT-hard-BG margin均值delta `-0.00090`，固定状态IoU均值delta `-0.00008`；loc3 query match foreground/background `0.6449/0.6921`、participation `0.7023/0.7660`，loc9为 `0.6007/0.6951`、`0.7488/0.8150`；目标模板token参与低于背景。融合后特征L2均值delta仅 `+0.02056`、cosine delta `+0.00008`，不支持 `tbsi_fuse_search` 抹掉有效修正 | `experiments/reports/m1_template_query_stage_diagnostic_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_TEMPLATE_QUERY_STAGE_DIAGNOSTIC_20261020/{validation_events.json,per_event.csv,summary.json,run.log}`; `tools/run_m1_template_query_stage_diagnostic_20261020.py` | query-match已在loc3输入处对模板前景/背景呈反向偏好；尚未证明MHSA是首因或训练监督问题。保留诊断记录、不训练、不调强度；下一步仅允许V2内部前景模板token对hard-context的单变量信号审计 |
| `M1-TEMPLATE-QUERY-ROLE-DIAGNOSTIC-20261020` | 冻结 M1 epoch15；仅在 `V2TemplateFusion` 增加默认关闭的 `target_context_soft`：每个模板 token 与搜索 crop 的 max cosine 减去相反角色原型的 max cosine，再与跨模态 agreement 组成 participation；同状态 `off` 为对照 | LasHeR trainingset identity-calibration-v2 冻结 validation 事件5个；同模板初始化、state、frame、crop 与 off-arm hard-background cell；FP32；无训练；test split 排除 | `DIAGNOSTIC-COMPLETE / ROLE-QUERY-REFUTED`。GT rank改善 `0/5`，top-1回到GT `0/5`，CENTER GT-hard-BG margin均值delta `-0.00215`；loc9 role-query前景/背景差 `-0.20097`，participation差 `-0.15907`，方向比原query差值 `-0.09441` 更偏背景 | `experiments/reports/m1_template_query_role_diagnostic_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_TEMPLATE_QUERY_ROLE_DIAGNOSTIC_20261020/{per_event.csv,summary.json,run.log,rerun.log}`; `tools/run_m1_template_query_role_diagnostic_20261020.py` | 五个选定train-side事件的机制诊断，不是总体性能结论。初次运行因hook mask维度失败，traceback保存在run.log；扩维后rerun完成。停止继续搜索query旁路或训练该候选；下一步回到逐阶段定位CENTER错误峰首次形成的位置 |

| `M1-LOW-AUC-INFO-FLOW-CASES-20261020` | 冻结受保护 M1 epoch15；对四条 Cdiag 代表序列逐层记录 block00-11、TBSI loc3/6/9、backbone norm、`tbsi_fuse_search` 前后几何及 CENTER GT-center/top-1 读出；只读、无干预 | LasHeR testingset 4条序列 × 前帧/onset 共8固定帧；trace state/crop replay；FP32；无训练；当前工作树回放，非 archive parity | `DIAGNOSTIC-COMPLETE / NO-UNIFIED-OPERATOR-ROOT-CAUSE`。`ab_bikeoccluded` 早层 RGB 弱后被 block02 修复、onset CENTER top1落在GT中心但IoU .365；`3rdfatboy` 早层双模态margin下降且最终RGB转负，CENTER偏GT中心1格、IoU .258；`leftfarboycomingpicktheball` TIR于block02转负、TBSI仅局部回升、IoU .339；`rightbottlecomes` RGB margin近零、TIR后层增强但CENTER仍偏1.68格，IoU .372。没有证据将统一首因归给MHSA或tbsi_fuse_search；误读后状态/crop反馈为已知放大链条 | `experiments/reports/m1_lowauc_information_flow_cases_20261020.md`; `output/experiments/M1_LOW_AUC_INFORMATION_FLOW_CASES_20261020/{per_event.csv,stage_metrics.csv,selected_events.json,summary.json,run.log}`; `tools/diagnose_m1_lowauc_information_flow_20261020.py` | Cdiag full-244 AUC只用于案例选择，不构成本诊断对照；本次支持下一步用独立train-side fixed-state做CENTER size/offset解码与早层/TBSI可逆单变量干预；停止无差别旁路扩展 |

